    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2114100/extras/bebcf2c0be0c16dcf65c68ad072842bf.poster.avif?t=1753746830\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2114100/extras/bebcf2c0be0c16dcf65c68ad072842bf.webm?t=1753746830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2114100/extras/bebcf2c0be0c16dcf65c68ad072842bf.mp4?t=1753746830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Congratulations! Fresh off the farm and out of the circuit-barn, you've been selected as a member of the Agrifront Circuit Engineers. You've finally got the chance to help out the war effort. Put out your pipe and grab your multimeter - you've got a job to do, Technician. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2114100/extras/75cc28a835e8f1fcc5c64a44c9b64cf0.poster.avif?t=1753746830\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2114100/extras/75cc28a835e8f1fcc5c64a44c9b64cf0.webm?t=1753746830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2114100/extras/75cc28a835e8f1fcc5c64a44c9b64cf0.mp4?t=1753746830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve handcrafted and increasingly complicated levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Optimize your solutions to increase your score</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the conflict between the Agrifront and the Assembly. Rewire everything from 3D printers to APCs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete optional sections to unlock collectibles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in the rustic soundtrack and pixel art visuals</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2114100/extras/c55a7483884795e9faf4406feb3d8948.avif?t=1753746830\" data-has-big /></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2114100/extras/bebcf2c0be0c16dcf65c68ad072842bf.poster.avif?t=1753746830\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2114100/extras/bebcf2c0be0c16dcf65c68ad072842bf.webm?t=1753746830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2114100/extras/bebcf2c0be0c16dcf65c68ad072842bf.mp4?t=1753746830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Congratulations! Fresh off the farm and out of the circuit-barn, you've been selected as a member of the Agrifront Circuit Engineers. You've finally got the chance to help out the war effort. Put out your pipe and grab your multimeter - you've got a job to do, Technician. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2114100/extras/75cc28a835e8f1fcc5c64a44c9b64cf0.poster.avif?t=1753746830\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2114100/extras/75cc28a835e8f1fcc5c64a44c9b64cf0.webm?t=1753746830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2114100/extras/75cc28a835e8f1fcc5c64a44c9b64cf0.mp4?t=1753746830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve handcrafted and increasingly complicated levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Optimize your solutions to increase your score</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the conflict between the Agrifront and the Assembly. Rewire everything from 3D printers to APCs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete optional sections to unlock collectibles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in the rustic soundtrack and pixel art visuals</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2114100/extras/c55a7483884795e9faf4406feb3d8948.avif?t=1753746830\" data-has-big /></div></p>",
    "short_description": "ReWire is a grid based puzzle game set in the near future. Splice wire blocks together to solve increasingly complicated circuits before they overload. Join the Agrifront and do your part for the folks back home.",
